{"slug":"standard-mobile","title":"Standard Mobile","desc":"An entry-level solution for low-risk workers, those on a budget or a hybrid workers. This doesn't require extra devices, use your mobile or landline phone.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/mobile-hero.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Standard Mobile\",\"title\":\"Affordable and Simple Safety Solution For Lone Workers\",\"intro\":\"Give your workers 24/7 protection without a device or smartphone.\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/mobile-hero.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/top-tabs {\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"SOS Alarm\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/SOS-Alarm.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Speed dial\",\"heading\":\"SOS Alarm\",\"content\":\"Open a two-way audio channel with the Alarm Receiving Centre via speed dial.\",\"linkText\":\"Read product brochure\",\"link\":\"/uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Standard-Mobile-flyer-low-res.pdf\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/standard-mobile-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Log activity\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/log-activity-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Check in/out\",\"heading\":\"Log activity\",\"content\":\"Users can manually check in, extend and check out of the system at the push of a button.\",\"linkText\":\"Read more\",\"link\":\"/uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Standard-Mobile-flyer-low-res.pdf%20\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/standard-mobile-tab3.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Pairing devices\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/icon-safety-devices.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Seamless coverage\",\"heading\":\"Pairing devices\",\"content\":\"Seamlessly operate between network coverage and no network signal areas using the SPOT X or Gen4.\",\"linkText\":\"Read more\",\"link\":\"/uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Standard-Mobile-flyer-low-res.pdf%20\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/standard-mobile-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Landline activation\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/landline-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Alternative access\",\"heading\":\"Landline activation\",\"content\":\"A unique PIN can be assigned to each user, enabling access to our system from any landline.\",\"linkText\":\"Read more\",\"link\":\"/uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Standard-Mobile-flyer-low-res.pdf\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/standard-mobile-tab4.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Voice memo\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/audio.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Additional information\",\"heading\":\"Voice memo\",\"content\":\"Leave details of an appointment and set a timer, which if not cancelled, will automatically raise an alarm. The memo will be made available to the Alarm Controller, providing them with additional information in an emergency.\",\"linkText\":\"Read more\",\"link\":\"/uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Standard-Mobile-flyer-low-res.pdf%20\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/standard-mobile-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Emergency response faster than 999\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/841920708\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your employees are protected 24/7/365 by our dedicated <a href=\"/uk/alarm-receiving-centre/\">Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC)</a>. We provide the quickest response in an emergency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>3 seconds to pick up alarms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 minute police response in threat-to-life situations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100% service uptime</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Simple worker protection\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/business-man-checking-phone-1024x683.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our standard mobile phone solution provides an easy to use and cost-effective solution for workers facing hazards. It’s perfect for employees who may need to raise an SOS alarm, but do not face risks such as slips, trips or falls. This user-friendly solution utilises existing mobile phones or landlines, meaning no extra device is needed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pairing with satellite devices</strong><br> Workers can operate seamlessly between network coverage and no network cover, by combining our standard mobile solution with the <a href=\"/products/spot-gen4/\">SPOT Gen4</a> or <a href=\"/products/spot-x/\">SPOT X</a> device.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If a user sets a timed activity on their mobile and moves into an area with no network coverage, they can cancel or extend their timer using their SPOT device.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get a Standard Mobile demo, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2024-07-17/2jj77k\",\"height\":550} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/related-content {\"title\":\"Alternative solutions\",\"items\":[{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:sos-app@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:lone-worker-app@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:mysos@@\"}]} /-->","menu_order":16,"types":["safety-devices"]}